<blockquote class="uncited"><div><br>For sure, some entries were missing in many Language files. I fixed that now.<br><br>Here is the patch for the fix about Chinese.xml file, if you want to check ip (yeah, the "APRS" and "EmergencySys" Ids don't even exist anymore):<div class="codebox"><p>CODE: </p><pre><code>diff --git a/Language/CPS/Chinese.xml b/Language/CPS/Chinese.xmlindex 37e304aa6d1b..8df0af11fee5 100644--- a/Language/CPS/Chinese.xml+++ b/Language/CPS/Chinese.xml@@ -417,8 +417,6 @@-                       &lt;TreeNode Id="EmergencySys" Text="APRS" /&gt;-                       &lt;TreeNode Id="APRS" Text="APRS ??" /&gt;@@ -449,6 +447,7 @@+                       &lt;MenuItem Id="tsmiEmgSystem" Text="APRS" /&gt;</code></pre></div><br>Cheers.<br>---<br>Daniel</div></blockquote><br>You mean that there is no Id="APRS" , but I also gave the screenshot. <br><br>When I add that ID in Chinese and English but not in Japanese, and change from CN to EN to JP, then display in following:<div class="inline-attachment"><dl class="file"><dt class="attach-image"><img src="http://localhost/opengd77/download/file.php?id=2279&amp;sid=05e3360da37dbfb36aa4986e4d767a78" class="postimage" alt="QQ??20240322193244.jpg" onclick="viewableArea(this);" /></dt></dl></div><div class="inline-attachment"><dl class="file"><dt class="attach-image"><img src="http://localhost/opengd77/download/file.php?id=2280&amp;sid=05e3360da37dbfb36aa4986e4d767a78" class="postimage" alt="QQ??20240322193216.jpg" onclick="viewableArea(this);" /></dt></dl></div><div class="inline-attachment"><dl class="file"><dt class="attach-image"><img src="http://localhost/opengd77/download/file.php?id=2281&amp;sid=05e3360da37dbfb36aa4986e4d767a78" class="postimage" alt="QQ??20240322193152.jpg" onclick="viewableArea(this);" /></dt></dl></div><p>Statistics: Posted by <a href="http://localhost/opengd77/memberlist.php?mode=viewprofile&amp;u=5469">BD4SMY</a> — Fri Mar 22, 2024 11:34 am</p><hr />
